        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michelle Trachtenberg, Tim Fywell, Hadley Davis, Meg Cabot, Joan Cusack, Kim Cattrall, Hayden Panettiere, Kirsten Olson\n- Works: Harriet the Spy, Inspector Gadget, EuroTrip, Ice Princess, Black Christmas, 17 Again, Cop Out, Weeds, Killing Kennedy\n- Roles: Nikki Fletcher, \"Jumping Shrimp\"\n- Topics: Film appearances, Ice Princess production, Casting\n\nFacts:\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in the film Harriet the Spy in 1996.\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in the film Inspector Gadget in 1999.\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in the film EuroTrip in 2004.\n- Ice Princess is a 2005 American figure-skating film directed by Tim Fywell and written by Hadley Davis from a story by Meg Cabot and Hadley Davis.\n- Ice Princess stars Michelle Trachtenberg, Joan Cusack, Kim Cattrall, and Hayden Panettiere.\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in the film Ice Princess in 2005.\n- Kirsten Olson played Nikki Fletcher, the \"Jumping Shrimp,\" in the Disney film Ice Princess in 2005.\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in the film Black Christmas in 2006.\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in the film 17 Again in 2009.\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in the film Cop Out in 2010.\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in Weeds in 2011.\n- Michelle Trachtenberg appeared in Killing Kennedy in 2013.",
